flowchart LR
    A[Road binary mask] --> B[Remove small blobs <120px]
    B --> C[Morph close + Skeletonize to 1px centerline]
    C --> D[Detect endpoints<br/>skeleton pixels with 1 neighbour]
    D --> E[Estimate endpoint tangent<br/>walk 12px along skeleton]
    E --> F[KDTree: candidate endpoint pairs within max_gap 150px]
    F --> G[Angle-aware filter<br/>tangents face each other, tol 45 deg]
    G --> H[Minimum Spanning Tree bridging<br/>Union-Find prevents loops]
    H --> I[Draw bridges + re-dilate to road width]
    I --> J[Continuous road network]
